# AISLING's pages (NACHTFAHRT's), on Skellig: every button and its presses, each page's knobs as the reader says them (one layout: a layer's main
# page K1 how much, K2 octave (the Drone: Reso; the Atmosphere: Width), K3 and K4 its own; its sound page brightness,
# envelope, Reverb, Echo), the voices on ALGORITHM, a knob turned, a layer's level on SELECT
wait 200
listen
wait 300
expect view 0
said Aisling page: Filter Off, Evolve 40, Motion 40, Drift 16 bars
tap HOME
wait 300
expect view 18
said Key page: Tempo 76, Root D, Mode Minor, Transpose Parallel
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
said Drone page, voice Organ: Pedal 90, Reso 0, Phaser 15, Attack 40
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 8
said Drone sound page, voice Organ: Colour 0, Release 50, Reverb 50, Echo 50
# (the filter motion) the layer's button once more: its Move page (Width, Time, Rate, Intro)
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 12
said Drone move page, voice Organ: Width
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 2
said Sequence page, voice Harp: Density 55, Octave 0, Length 12, Grid 16ths
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 9
said Seq sound page, voice Harp: Cutoff 55, Decay 80, Reverb 50, Echo 50
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 13
said Repeats page, voice Harp: Repeat A 100, A time 1/8., Repeat B 0, B time 1/4
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 23
said Seq move page, voice Harp: Width
tap ARP
wait 300
expect view 2
tap LFO
wait 300
expect view 3
said Lead page, voice Flute: Phrases 95, Octave 0, Glide 15, Vibrato 12
tap LFO
wait 300
expect view 10
said Lead sound page, voice Flute: Tone 50, Attack 10, Reverb 90, Echo 90
tap LFO
wait 300
expect view 14
said Lead move page, voice Flute: Width
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 4
said Sequence 2 page, voice Moog: Chance 100, Octave -1, Length 7, Level 0
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 11
said Seq2 sound page, voice Moog: Cutoff 40, Decay 35, Reverb 50, Echo 50
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 16
tap SEQ
wait 300
expect view 24
said Seq2 move page, voice Moog: Width
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect view 19
said Atmosphere page, character Surf: Density 0, Width 50, Drift 0, Air 0
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect view 21
said Atmos sound page, character Surf: Colour 0, Ring 50, Reverb 50, Echo 50
tap SAVE
wait 300
expect view 25
said Atmos move page, character Surf: Width
tap FX
wait 300
expect view 5
said Space page: Echo
tap FX
wait 300
expect view 20
said Echo page: Blur
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 6
said Setup page: Tune 0, MIDI out On
tap GLO
wait 300
expect view 22
# ((AISLING) Skellig's Lead in 4: the Flute heard from the first half-minute)
said Arc page: Lead in 4, Bridge 40, Arc 20, Memory 60
# a knob on the Arc page: its help line shown as it turns (the review: the Arc's row was missing, NULL)
turn K1 1
wait 300
said Lead in 5
turn K1 -1
wait 300
# (the Lead's memory) the fourth knob: Memory, Skellig's 60, the Lead's own parameter (130)
turn K4 1
wait 300
said Memory 61
expect par130 61
turn K4 -1
wait 300
expect par130 60
# the voices: ALGORITHM on a layer's page
tap ENV
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said VOICE Strings
expect par22 1
tap LFO
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
wait 300
said VOICE Theremin
# a knob: its value said once it settles
tap ARP
wait 300
spin K3 -4
wait 300
said Length 8
expect par28 8
# a layer's level: SELECT (1 a detent; octsel.amb has the rest; Skellig's Sequence at 44, under its Lead)
expect par1 44
spin SELECT 5
wait 300
expect par1 49
# every page's knobs have a help line, NACHTFAHRT's, and each fits the rule
expect helpfit 0
